WEBVTT

00:07:28.906 --> 00:07:32.367
We did everything that we could

00:07:33.366 --> 00:07:36.396
to bring attention

00:07:36.420 --> 00:07:40.483
to a situation that was
not good for people

00:07:40.507 --> 00:07:42.143
and then we could organize people.

00:07:42.167 --> 00:07:44.698
There were religious leaders

00:07:45.430 --> 00:07:51.415
teachers and lawyers and others
in these communities and neighborhoods.

00:07:51.439 --> 00:07:54.955
There would come a time
through the training

00:07:54.979 --> 00:07:58.482
and accepting nonviolence,

00:07:59.555 --> 00:08:02.410
the philosophy as a way of living,